  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "全球金融創新趨勢",
    "sub_ename": "GLOBAL TREND OF FINANCIAL INNOVATION",
    "describe_ch": "近年來，金融創新與發展已蔚為全球趨勢。本課程擬介紹跨境電商金融、互聯網金融、供應鏈金融、及物聯網金融等金融科技與創新，並研讀案例，以增進學生於金融創新發展全球趨勢之了解。",
    "describe_eh": "Recent years, financial innovation and development have been a global trend. This course aims to introduce the new financial technology and innovation, including the cross-border e-commerce finance, internet finance, supply chain finance and IoT finance. Some cases will also be discussed in class. The purpose is to help students’ understanding of the global trend of financial innovation and development.",
